These are artistically scaled city and district miniatures, not navigation maps
or affiliated representations of the buildings, attractions or their operators.
Lisbon includes a labelled Pena Palace / Sintra excursion inset, not its actual
geographic location. Moon Base is an invented lunar settlement.
